<section class="doc-section" id="sec-ds">
  <div class="sec-label">02 · Design System</div>
  <h2 class="sec-title">Quiet · Private · Reflective · Warm</h2>
  <p class="sec-intro">整套系统建立在「私人日报」而非「数据仪表盘」的隐喻之上：暖纸色背景、衬线标题、低饱和分类色、大量留白。没有红色警报，没有绿色得分，没有任何一种颜色被用来评价用户的行为。</p>

  <div class="sub-h">品牌色 · Core Palette</div>
  <div class="grid g4">
    <div class="card swatch"><div class="chip" style="background:#3E5C52;"></div><div class="info"><b>Still Pool 静潭</b><span>#3E5C52</span><i>品牌主色 · 符号 / 主按钮 / 强调</i></div></div>
    <div class="card swatch"><div class="chip" style="background:#26241F;"></div><div class="info"><b>Ink 墨</b><span>#26241F</span><i>正文标题 · 深色模式底色</i></div></div>
    <div class="card swatch"><div class="chip" style="background:#FAF8F3;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"></div><div class="info"><b>Paper 纸</b><span>#FAF8F3</span><i>全局背景 · 暖白而非冷灰</i></div></div>
    <div class="card swatch"><div class="chip" style="background:#E9EFEA;"></div><div class="info"><b>Pool Mist 潭雾</b><span>#E9EFEA</span><i>强调底色 · 选中态 · 状态徽标</i></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid g4" style="margin-top:20px;">
    <div class="card swatch"><div class="chip" style="background:#57534A;"></div><div class="info"><b>Ink Soft</b><span>#57534A</span><i>次级文字</i></div></div>
    <div class="card swatch"><div class="chip" style="background:#8A857B;"></div><div class="info"><b>Ink Faint</b><span>#8A857B</span><i>辅助说明 · 时间戳</i></div></div>
    <div class="card swatch"><div class="chip" style="background:#E8E4DB;"></div><div class="info"><b>Line</b><span>#E8E4DB</span><i>分隔线 · 描边</i></div></div>
    <div class="card swatch"><div class="chip" style="background:#8C6A5C;"></div><div class="info"><b>Clay 陶</b><span>#8C6A5C</span><i>唯一的「注意」色：仅用于删除等不可逆操作，从不用于评价行为</i></div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="sub-h">分类色 · Category Palette（低饱和，无好坏之分）</div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="cat-row"><span class="cat-dot" style="background:#5B7186;"></span><b>Create 创造</b><code>#5B7186</code><span>写作、设计、编程、做饭、摄影——制作任何东西</span></div>
    <div class="cat-row"><span class="cat-dot" style="background:#B98F5F;"></span><b>Communicate 沟通</b><code>#B98F5F</code><span>邮件、会议、即时通讯、协作</span></div>
    <div class="cat-row"><span class="cat-dot" style="background:#7E9377;"></span><b>Learn 学习</b><code>#7E9377</code><span>文章、研究资料、课程、书籍</span></div>
    <div class="cat-row"><span class="cat-dot" style="background:#A59E93;"></span><b>Manage 打理</b><code>#A59E93</code><span>财务、表格、日程、文件与生活事务</span></div>
    <div class="cat-row"><span class="cat-dot" style="background:#A98794;"></span><b>Personal 个人</b><code>#A98794</code><span>非工作性质的个人活动</span></div>
    <div class="cat-row"><span class="cat-dot" style="background:#8F86A8;"></span><b>Rest &amp; Enjoy 休息与享受</b><code>#8F86A8</code><span>视频、游戏、闲逛——休息不是负面行为</span></div>
    <div class="cat-row"><span class="cat-dot" style="background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#6B6862 0 3px,#918D85 3px 6px);"></span><b>Private 私密</b><code>#6B6862</code><span>斜纹填充，系统不展示内容</span></div>
    <div class="cat-row"><span class="cat-dot" style="background:transparent;border:1.5px dashed #B8B3AB;"></span><b>Unclassified 未分类</b><code>#B8B3AB</code><span>虚线描边，等待用户确认，不进入长期记忆</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="sub-h">字体系统 · Typography</div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="type-row"><div class="type-spec">Display / Serif<br>Newsreader 500 · 28px<br>中文：思源宋体</div><div style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:28px;font-weight:500;">Where did your time go today?</div></div>
    <div class="type-row"><div class="type-spec">Title / Serif<br>Newsreader 500 · 22px</div><div style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:22px;font-weight:500;">Sunday, July 26 · 今天的时间去了哪里</div></div>
    <div class="type-row"><div class="type-spec">Body / Sans<br>Inter 400 · 15px / 1.65<br>中文：苹方 / 思源黑体</div><div style="font-size:15px;max-width:520px;">今天你主要在规划 HelpMeBe.Me 的第一个版本。上午出现了一段 68 分钟的连续产品思考时间。</div></div>
    <div class="type-row"><div class="type-spec">Caption / Sans<br>Inter 400 · 12.5px · Ink Faint</div><div style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-faint);">Based on the time HelpMeBe.Me was able to observe. This may not represent your full day.</div></div>
    <div class="type-row"><div class="type-spec">Numeric / Mono<br>SF Mono 500 · 13px</div><div style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;font-weight:500;">09:45–10:53 · 68 min · confidence 87%</div></div>
  </div>
  <p class="note" style="margin-top:14px;">衬线体只用于「产品对用户说话」的时刻（页面标题、摘要、反思问题）；无衬线体承担所有界面功能文字；等宽字体只用于时间与数据。三种声音，各司其职。</p>

  <div class="sub-h">间距与圆角 · Spacing &amp; Radius</div>
  <div class="grid g2">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="space-demo">
        <div class="s" style="width:20px;height:4px;">4</div>
        <div class="s" style="width:24px;height:8px;">8</div>
        <div class="s" style="width:28px;height:12px;">12</div>
        <div class="s" style="width:32px;height:16px;">16</div>
        <div class="s" style="width:40px;height:24px;">24</div>
        <div class="s" style="width:48px;height:32px;">32</div>
        <div class="s" style="width:56px;height:48px;">48</div>
        <div class="s" style="width:64px;height:64px;">64</div>
      </div>
      <p class="note" style="padding:0 24px 20px;">8px 基础网格。页面级留白偏大（48–64px），让界面「呼吸」，像一页纸而不是一块面板。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="padding:26px 24px;display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <div style="width:72px;height:72px;border:1.5px solid var(--accent);border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--accent-deep);">8</div>
      <div style="width:72px;height:72px;border:1.5px solid var(--accent);border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--accent-deep);">12</div>
      <div style="width:72px;height:72px;border:1.5px solid var(--accent);border-radius:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--accent-deep);">16</div>
      <div style="width:72px;height:72px;border:1.5px solid var(--accent);border-radius:24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--accent-deep);">24</div>
      <p class="note" style="flex-basis:100%;">radius-sm 8 控件 · radius-md 12 按钮/输入框 · radius-lg 16 卡片 · radius-xl 24 大容器。阴影极轻，仅两级。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sub-h">核心组件 · Components</div>
  <div class="grid g2">
    <div class="card comp-cell">
      <h5>Buttons</h5>
      <div class="comp-stage">
        <button class="btn btn-primary">Keep as memory</button>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary">Edit</button>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost">Nothing today</button>
        <button class="btn btn-quiet-danger">Delete this day</button>
      </div>
      <p class="note">主按钮是全站唯一的实色元素，一屏最多出现一次。首次出现写全「Keep as memory」，之后可简称「Keep」；完成反馈固定为「Saved to Memories.」——不让用户猜测 Keep 的数据后果。「Nothing today」与主按钮权重接近：不保存是同样正当的选择。删除按钮真实、可见，但不使用警报红。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card comp-cell">
      <h5>Status Pills · 录制状态</h5>
      <div class="comp-stage">
        <span class="pill-status pill-rec"><span class="pulse"></span>Recording</span>
        <span class="pill-status pill-paused">⏸ Paused · until 15:00</span>
        <span class="pill-status pill-private">◐ Private Mode</span>
      </div>
      <p class="note">录制状态永远可见（菜单栏 + 应用内）。暂停不是「失败态」，用的是中性的暖沙色而非警告色。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card comp-cell">
      <h5>Category Chips</h5>
      <div class="comp-stage">
        <span class="chip-cat"><i style="background:#5B7186;"></i>Create</span>
        <span class="chip-cat"><i style="background:#B98F5F;"></i>Communicate</span>
        <span class="chip-cat"><i style="background:#7E9377;"></i>Learn</span>
        <span class="chip-cat"><i style="background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#6B6862 0 2px,#918D85 2px 4px);"></i>Private</span>
        <span class="chip-cat" style="border-style:dashed;"><i style="border:1.5px dashed #B8B3AB;background:none;"></i>Unclassified</span>
      </div>
      <p class="note">方形圆角色点（非圆点）作为分类识别符，避免与状态指示灯混淆。可点击切换分类。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card comp-cell">
      <h5>Evidence Tags · 二级透明层</h5>
      <div class="comp-stage">
        <span class="tag-fact">FACT</span>
        <span class="tag-inference">INFERENCE</span>
        <span class="tag-nodata">INSUFFICIENT DATA</span>
        <span class="toggle on" title="toggle"></span>
        <span class="toggle" title="toggle"></span>
      </div>
      <p class="note">Fact / Inference 是内部数据模型与二级层标签，不出现在主界面句子上。主层永远用自然语言（Based on your recorded activity… / This may be a pattern…）；展开 Why? 后才显示 Type / Evidence / Confidence / Data coverage——透明分层，避免法务化与 AI 审计感。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style is:global>
    .st-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 11px;border-radius:8px;}
