  </style>

  <div class="sub-h">核心信任模型 · Activity vs Memory（V1.1 新增）</div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="flowbox">
      <div class="fb fb-activity"><b>Activity</b><span>Temporary · Automatically collected · Expires in 7 days</span></div>
      <div class="arrow">→ &nbsp;You choose&nbsp; →</div>
      <div class="fb fb-memory"><b>Memory</b><span>Intentional · Long-term · Owned by you</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="note" style="padding:0 28px 22px;text-align:center;">这是 HelpMeBe.Me 与监控工具之间最重要的边界，在 Onboarding 与 Privacy 页均以此图呈现。术语全站唯一：Timeline 中的是 Activity；用户确认后才是 Memory；不混用 Record / History。Reflection 只使用事实与已确认的 Memory。三条承诺：系统看到的 ≠ 永久记住；AI 建议的 ≠ 用户事实；局部数据 ≠ 整个人生。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid g2" style="margin-top:20px;">
    <div class="card comp-cell">
      <h5>状态语言 · Status Labels</h5>
      <div class="comp-stage">
        <span class="st-chip st-suggested">Suggested</span>
        <span class="st-chip st-review">Needs review</span>
        <span class="st-chip st-confirmed">✓ Confirmed</span>
      </div>
      <p class="note">主界面只出现这三个状态词。「confidence 87%」这类裸数值一律降级到「Why?」二级解释层——技术透明放在第二层，不增加主界面的技术感与不信任。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card comp-cell">
      <h5>三种隐私语义 · Privacy States</h5>
      <div class="pstate-row"><span class="ps-chip st-chip st-review">Not recorded</span><p>系统未采集任何内容，只知道该时段被暂停或排除。最严格状态，不写作 "Private · details not recorded"。</p></div>
      <div class="pstate-row"><span class="ps-chip st-chip" style="background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#EEEBE5 0 4px,#F6F4F0 4px 8px);color:#57534A;">Hidden activity</span><p>活动存在，界面隐藏具体标题，只显示时长。</p></div>
      <div class="pstate-row"><span class="ps-chip st-chip st-confirmed">◐ Private memory</span><p>用户保存的内容，仅本人可见，不参与 Reflection 与 AI 推断。</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="note" style="margin-top:14px;">分类语言（V1.2 起为正式命名）：MVP 直接采用生活语言，不再从 Building/Admin 迁移——命名影响用户理解、AI Prompt、数据模型与周报语言，越晚改成本越高。Create 覆盖写作、设计、编程、做饭与任何创作，面向人生而非只面向 founder。P1 允许用户重命名或自定义分类。</p>

  <div class="sub-h">语言规范 · Voice &amp; Tone</div>
  <div class="card">
    <table class="voice-table">
      <tr><td style="width:50%;" class="voice-ok">✓ Something worth noticing.</td><td class="voice-no">You wasted three hours.</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="voice-ok">✓ What HelpMeBe.Me could see today</td><td class="voice-no">Today's coverage: 70%</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="voice-ok">✓ Based on the time HelpMeBe.Me was able to observe.</td><td class="voice-no">Your productivity is poor.</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="voice-ok">✓ This may not represent your full day.</td><td class="voice-no">You failed to meet your goals.</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="voice-ok">✓ You can change or delete this at any time.</td><td class="voice-no">You are becoming lazy.</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="voice-ok">✓ Does this reflect how you want to spend your time?</td><td class="voice-no">You should work harder.</td></tr>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p class="note" style="margin-top:14px;">界面语气：平静、尊重、中性。不使用连续打卡、勋章、排名、红色未完成提示。产品呈现事实与变化，评价权永远属于用户。</p>
